msgid "Godot's architecture overview"
msgstr "Visão geral da arquitetura do Godot"

msgid ""
"The following diagram describes the most important aspects of Godot's "
"architecture. It's not designed to be exhaustive, with the purpose of just "
"giving a high-level overview of the main components and their relationships "
"to each other."
msgstr ""
"O diagrama a seguir descreve os aspectos mais importantes da arquitetura do "
"Godot. Ele não foi projetado para ser exaustivo, tendo o propósito de apenas "
"dar uma visão geral de alto nível dos principais componentes e de suas "
"relações entre si."

msgid ""
"Diagram of Godot's Architecture; divided into three layers (from top to "
"bottom: Scene layer, Server layer, and Drivers & Platform interface layer), "
"with Core and Main separated on the right side since they interact with all "
"layers."
msgstr ""
"Diagrama da Arquitetura do Godot; dividido em três camadas (de cima para "
"baixo: Camada de Cena, Camada de Servidor e Camada de Drivers e Interface de "
"Plataforma), com Core e Main separados no lado direito, pois interagem com "
"todas as camadas."

msgid ""
"Credit: `Hendrik Brucker <https://github.com/Geometror/godot-architecture-"
"diagram>`__"
msgstr ""
"Crédito: `Hendrik Brucker <https://github.com/Geometror/godot-architecture-"
"diagram>`__"

msgid "Scene Layer"
msgstr "Camada de Cena"

msgid ""
"The Scene layer is the highest level of Godot's architecture, providing the "
"scene system, which is the main way to build and structure your applications "
"or games. See :ref:`class_SceneTree` / :ref:`doc_scene_tree` "
"and :ref:`class_Node` for more information."
msgstr ""
"A camada de Cena (Scene layer) é o nível mais alto da arquitetura do Godot, "
"fornecendo o sistema de cenas, que é a principal maneira de construir e "
"estruturar seus aplicativos ou jogos. "
"Veja :ref:`class_SceneTree` / :ref:`doc_scene_tree` e :ref:`class_Node` para "
"mais informações."

msgid ""
"Corresponding source code: `/scene/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/scene>`__"
msgstr ""
"Código-fonte correspondente: `/scene/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/scene>`__"

msgid "Server Layer"
msgstr "Camada de Servidor"

msgid ""
"Server components implement most of Godot's subsystems (rendering, audio, "
"physics, etc.). They are singleton objects initialized at engine startup."
msgstr ""
"Os componentes de Servidor (Server components) implementam a maioria dos "
"subsistemas do Godot (renderização, áudio, física, etc.). Eles são objetos "
"singleton inicializados na inicialização da engine."

msgid ""
"`Why does Godot use servers and RIDs? <https://godotengine.org/article/why-"
"does-godot-use-servers-and-rids>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Por que o Godot usa servidores e RIDs? <https://godotengine.org/article/why-"
"does-godot-use-servers-and-rids>`__"

msgid ""
"Corresponding source code: `/servers/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/servers>`__"
msgstr ""
"Código-fonte correspondente: `/servers/* <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/tree/master/servers>`__"

msgid "Drivers / Platform Interface"
msgstr "Drivers / Interface de Plataforma"

msgid ""
"This layer abstracts low-level platform-specific details, containing drivers "
"for graphics APIs, audio backends and operating system interfaces (all "
"platform-specific :ref:`class_OS` and :ref:`class_DisplayServer` "
"implementations)."
msgstr ""
"Esta camada abstrai detalhes de baixo nível específicos de cada plataforma, "
"contendo drivers para APIs gráficas, backends de áudio e interfaces de "
"sistema operacional (todas as implementações específicas de plataforma "
"de :ref:`class_OS` e :ref:`class_DisplayServer`)."

msgid ""
"Corresponding source code: `/drivers/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/drivers>`__ and `/platform/* <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/tree/master/platform>`__"
msgstr ""
"Código-fonte correspondente: `/drivers/* <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/tree/master/drivers>`__ e `/platform/* <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/tree/master/platform>`__"

msgid "Core"
msgstr "Componentes Principais"

msgid ""
"The Engine's core contains essential functionality and data structures used "
"throughout the engine, like :ref:`class_Object` "
"and :ref:`class_ClassDB`, :ref:`memory management "
"<doc_core_types>`, :ref:`containers <doc_core_types>`, file I/"
"O, :ref:`Variant <doc_variant_class>`, and :ref:`other utilities "
"<doc_common_engine_methods_and_macros>`."
msgstr ""
"O núcleo da Engine (Core) contém funcionalidades essenciais e estruturas de "
"dados usadas por todo o motor, como :ref:`class_Object` "
"e :ref:`class_ClassDB`, :ref:`gerenciamento de memória "
"<doc_core_types>`, :ref:`contêineres <doc_core_types>`, E/S de "
"arquivos, :ref:`Variant <doc_variant_class>` e :ref:`outros utilitários "
"<doc_common_engine_methods_and_macros>`."

msgid ""
"Corresponding source code: `/core/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/core>`__"
msgstr ""
"Código-fonte correspondente: `/core/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/core>`__"

msgid "Main"
msgstr "Principal"

msgid ""
"The Main component is responsible for initializing and managing the engine "
"lifecycle, including startup, shutdown, and the main loop. "
"See :ref:`class_MainLoop` for more details."
msgstr ""
"O componente Main é responsável por inicializar e gerenciar o ciclo de vida "
"da engine, incluindo a inicialização, o desligamento e o loop principal. "
"Veja :ref:`class_MainLoop` para mais detalhes."

msgid ""
"Corresponding source code: `/main/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/main>`__"
msgstr ""
"Código-fonte correspondente: `/main/* <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"tree/master/main>`__"
